slash dev ops dash A I.

182
00:05:45,033 --> 00:05:46,724
Install it like before,

183
00:05:46,724 --> 00:05:47,901
then run lab up,

184
00:05:47,901 --> 00:05:51,136
and work inside slash opt slash lab seventy.

185
00:05:51,686 --> 00:05:52,997
One: log in as Bob,

186
00:05:52,997 --> 00:05:55,551
with the password in the lab message,

187
00:05:55,551 --> 00:05:57,207
